            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pangakaŵa ŵandu taciŵecetaga kuti, “Nginitukola mwenye sambano ligongo nginitwapikanila AMBUJE. Nambope mwenyejo akatutendele cici uwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayimwenewo akusaŵeceta maloŵe gangali mate. Akusagamba kutenda yilanga ya unami. Cilungamo ciŵele kungalungama kwele kukusasipuka mpela manyasi gakusakala mu mgunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Samaliya tacitenda woga, nipo tacilila ligongo lyakonanjidwa kwa cilandanyo ca mwanace jwa ng'ombe ca ku Beti Afeni. Ŵandu ŵakwe tacimlilila. Nombe nawo ŵakutaga ŵawo mbopesi tacilila malilo ga mlungu jwawojo, ligongo ucimbicimbi wawo wosope utyosile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilandanyoco ticicijigalidwa kwawula ku Asiliya, kuti cikaŵe mtuka wakupelecedwa kwa mwenye jwamkulungwa. Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli tacitenda soni, Aisalaeli tacitenda soni ligongo lya malangiso ga unami giŵapikanilaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Samaliya tacijigalidwa kwawula kutali mpela kalunyambi kakakujajaŵala pa mesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malo gawo gakulambililako milungu ja unami, kwele Aisalaeli ŵatendelagako ulemwa, tigacijonanjidwa. Miŵa ni manyasi tiyicimela pa malo gakupelecela mbopesigo. Ŵandu tacigasalila matumbi kuti, “Mtugwile!” Taciyisalila soni yikwesya kuti, “Mtucinjilicisye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.23.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 23:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciw 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akuŵeceta kuti tacipeleka cilango kwa Aisalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akuŵeceta kuti, “Jemanja Aisalaeli nginimlecepe kulemwa kutyocela ndaŵi jejila ku Gibeya. Ali ni ligongo lyakwe tacipundidwa pa ngondo ku Gibeya peko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.19.1+JDG.19.2+JDG.19.3+JDG.19.4+JDG.19.5+JDG.19.6+JDG.19.7+JDG.19.8+JDG.19.9+JDG.19.10+JDG.19.11+JDG.19.12+JDG.19.13+JDG.19.14+JDG.19.15+JDG.19.16+JDG.19.17+JDG.19.18+JDG.19.19+JDG.19.20+JDG.19.21+JDG.19.22+JDG.19.23+JDG.19.24+JDG.19.25+JDG.19.26+JDG.19.27+JDG.19.28+JDG.19.29+JDG.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ŵak 19:1-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinjiyika kulimbana ni ŵandu ŵa upanduŵa kuti nape cilango. Ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tacisongana kuti amenyane nawo ngondo ligongo lya ulemwa wawo wejinji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kalakala Aisalaeli ŵaliji mpela kang'ombe kakajiganyidwe cenene kikanonyelega kuliŵata tiligu. Nambo nganisisye kwika likongwa mu lukosi lwakwe lwakusalala kuti akamulisye masengo mwakupunda. Natesile Yuda kuti atipuleje nipo Yakobo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " alimeje mu mgunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natite kuti, ‘Mlime malo gasambano, mlimisile mcilungamo, nipo timcigowola upile wa cinonyelo cangu cangacenga. Tipulani migunda jenu pakuti ndaŵi jakwasosasosa AMBUJE jikwanile. Mwasosesose AMBUJEWO mpaka ali ayice kukumgwicisya jemanja ula ja upile.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yel 4:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo m'malo mwakwe mpandile yakulemweceka, ni kugowola yisogosi yakwe. Mlile yisogosi yakwe yakutyocela m'mabosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ligongo mkukulupilila mnope pa mageleta genu, ni winji wa asilikali ŵenu ŵa ngondo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "myoyo amagongo ŵenu taciyika kuputa namwe ngondo. Malo genu gecinjilicisidwe tigacijonanjidwa mpela mwele mwenye Shalimani muŵamjonanjile msinda wa Beti Abeli pa lisiku lya ngondo. Acinangolo ni ŵanace ŵawo ŵawulajidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeleyo ni yiticitendekwa kwa jemanja, ŵandu ŵa ku Beteli, ligongo lya yakusakala yakogoya yimtesile. Ngondo pitijicigamba kutanda, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli taciwulajidwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
